			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1876963">
									

<p>See, I read that differently. It doesn't really say that it exchanges life energy. It says that it's based on the theory that it can exchange life energy. In fact, that was a big part of what sold it for me. I got this little bit of the researcher's voice in there, saying &quot;It's based on the idea that life energy is a thing and you can move it around, which is total bullshit, but goddamnit the SOB works! HOW?!&quot;</p>
<p>I also don't see this as adding a face to Dark. What more do we really know about him now?</p>

